/LICENSE                                @madkatomega-sys
/NOTICE                                 @madkatomega-sys
/GOVERNANCE.md                          @madkatomega-sys
/CONTRIBUTING.md                        @madkatomega-sys
/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md                     @madkatomega-sys
/SECURITY.md                            @madkatomega-sys

